{
  "name": "fbx_generic",
  "description": "FBX for any engine or DCC: -Z forward and Y up with the space transform baked, unit scale applied, deform bones only, no leaf bones, no animation, textures as PNG files beside the FBX. Bones are named by role through bone_map, which ships with the template's names; edit a value to rename that bone in the file (the model keeps its names). Roles missing from the map keep the model's names.",
